# Saral Pooja — EmailJS credentials
#
# Where to get these (https://dashboard.emailjs.com):
#   EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY   → Account > General > Public Key
#   EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID   → Email Services > (your service) > Service ID
#   EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID  → Email Templates > (your template) > Template ID
#
# The autoreply to the person who submitted the form is configured entirely
# inside the EmailJS template/dashboard — nothing extra is needed on the
# website side for that part.
#
# After editing this file, regenerate config.js by running:
#   node scripts/generate-config.js
#
# This file is listed in .gitignore — replace the placeholders below with
# your real values, but don't commit it with real credentials in it.

EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here
EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id_here
EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id_here
